** Workshop exercise 02: self-weight of a cantilever meshed by Gmsh (our own deck).
** Units: N, mm, s; density in t/mm^3 (CalculiX 2.21 manual section 3).
** The mesh comes from:  gmsh beam.geo -3 -format inp -o beam_mesh.inp
*INCLUDE, INPUT=beam_mesh.inp
*MATERIAL, NAME=STEEL
*ELASTIC
210000., 0.3
*DENSITY
7.85E-9
*SOLID SECTION, ELSET=BEAM, MATERIAL=STEEL
*STEP
*STATIC
*BOUNDARY
FIXED, 1, 3
*DLOAD
BEAM, GRAV, 9810., 0., -1., 0.
*NODE PRINT, NSET=TIP
U
*NODE PRINT, NSET=FIXED, TOTALS=ONLY
RF
*NODE FILE
U
*EL FILE
S
*END STEP
